 34CL c  1982Va02: 11.7 and 16.3-MeV |a beams from from the Utrecht 6-MV Van de 
 34CL2c  Graaff accelerator impinged on a target of 100-|mg/cm{+2} P on thick Au
 34CL3c  backing. |g ray were detected using a large solid angle                
 34CL4c  Compton-suppression spectrometer (LACSS) and a HPGe central detector in
 34CL5c  combination with four gating Ge(Li) detectors. Measured E|g, I|g.      
 34CL6c  Deduced lifetimes from Doppler pattern (DSAM). Also measured the       
 34CL7c  24MG(12C,PNG)34CL reaction.                                            
 34CL d                                                                         
 34CL c  1978Ba61,1978Ba77: 13 and 14.6-MeV |a beams from the 7.5-MV Van de     
 34CL2c  Graaff accelerator at the Strasbourg Nuclear Research Center, France,  
 34CL3c  impinged on a 200-|mg/cm{+2} red phosphorus target. |g rays were       
 34CL4c  detected using two Ge(Li) detectors. Measured |g(|q). Deduced mixing   
 34CL5c  ratios, lifetimes using RDM.                                           
 34CL d                                                                         
 34CL c  1978Ba39: 14.4-MeV |a beams from the 7.5-MV Van de Graaff accelerator  
 34CL2c  at the Strasbourg Nuclear Research Center, France, impinged on a       
 34CL3c  200-|mg/cm{+2} red phosphorus target. Neutrons were detected using a   
 34CL4c  NE213 liquid scintillator. |g rays were detected using a Ge(Li)        
 34CL5c  detector. Measured n|g-coin. 1978Ba39 is primarily a                   
 34CL6c  {+27}Al({+12}C,|an|g)34Cl reaction measurement.                        
 34CL d                                                                         
 34CL c  1971Ba98: 0.3-0.7 MeV>threshold |a beams was from the Padova 5.5 MV Van
 34CL2c  de Graaff generator. Targets were 100-|mg/cm{+3} evaporated            
 34CL3c  Zn{-3}P{-2}. |g rays were detected using a 55-cm{+3} Ge(li) detector.  
 34CL4c  Deduced lifetimes using RDM.                                           
 34CL d                                                                         
 34CL c  1970Br10: 7.50-8.75-MeV |a beam impinged on a 600-|mg/cm{+2} red       
 34CL2c  phosphorus target. |g rays were detected using a Ge(Li) detector.      
 34CL3c  Deduced lifetimes using DSAM. Also measured |g-ray angular             
 34CL4c  distributions in {+32}S({+3}He,p|g){+34}Cl reaction.                   
